      "en": "For he was amazed, and all who were with him, at the catch of fish which they had caught;",
      "ko": "이는 자기와 및 함께 있는 모든 사람이 고기 잡힌 것을 인하여 놀라고",
      "source_text_hash": "c3b1f51b998d2bfc7c3740cc08d2ca3f45e4a621e990b260e01e8f3dc68906c5",
